  "Version": 16,
  "DisplayName": "JSM Ops",
  "Description": "Integrates Google SecOps SOAR with Jira Service Management Ops for alert lifecycle management: create, get, list, acknowledge, assign, escalate, close, notes, tags, priority updates, extra properties, on-call lookup, and a one-way Sync Cases job that closes linked JSM Ops alerts when a SecOps case tagged JSM is closed. This integration is owned by the \"community\". Support Contact: thecomputercowboy@proton.me.",
  "ImageBase64": "",
